{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56874","headline":"刘明德墓志铭末附歌 · 佚名","name":"刘明德墓志铭末附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哀哉哲人，於何是美。\n言满山川，名扬闾□（疑爲「里」字）。\n上敬而恭，下问不耻。\n直而能谦，和而有礼。\n奈何龙剑，俱沉逝水。\n风树萧萧，荒坟累累。\n曾闵攀号，哀情摧毁。\n中外痛咽兮苦深，肠断绝兮不能已已。\n（见《山右石刻丛编》卷八《唐故校尉守左武卫泾州四门府折冲都尉员外置同正员赐紫金鱼袋上柱国刘府君墓志铭》。\n刘明德字节望，长庆二年卒）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}